1
00:01:59,757 --> 00:02:00,632
Penny!
Penny!

2
00:02:00,882 --> 00:02:03,048
撑...撑住啊!
Just hold on!

3
00:02:33,965 --> 00:02:37,382
我... 在哪里?
Where... am I?

4
00:03:12,882 --> 00:03:15,798
等等 先不要!
Hey, no, wait! Wait!

5
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,798
拜托 快停下 停下啊!
Stop it, please! Stop!

6
00:03:44,173 --> 00:03:46,048
我以为我永远不会再见到你们了
I thought maybe I would never see you again.

7
00:03:49,173 --> 00:03:51,757
但是我肯定只要等得够久
But I knew if I waited long enough

8
00:03:52,048 --> 00:03:53,757
你们就会掉落下来的
then, you would fall.

9
00:03:55,423 --> 00:03:56,965
正如我一样
Just like I did.

10
00:04:01,423 --> 00:04:04,757
真的 真的是你们吗?
It's... it's really you right?

11
00:04:05,507 --> 00:04:07,382
当我在市场看到你们 我...
hen I saw you in the market, I

12
00:04:09,548 --> 00:04:12,673
Jaune 是我们啊
Jaune, it's us.

13
00:04:20,632 --> 00:04:21,632
你怎么找到我们的?
How did you find us?

14
00:04:21,673 --> 00:04:23,215
你怎么会当了锈迹骑士?
How are you the rusted knight?

15
00:04:23,257 --> 00:04:24,882
你又是什么时候变得那么
And when did you get so

16
00:04:24,923 --> 00:04:25,673
成熟的?
mature?

17
00:04:29,798 --> 00:04:33,757
在我们掉下去之后 擎天那边发生什么事了?
What happened in Atlas? After the rest of us fell?

18
00:04:35,548 --> 00:04:39,215
我 我想我们有很多信息要同步一下
I.. I guess we got a lot of catching up to do.

19
00:04:44,007 --> 00:04:47,173
她现在手上有两个圣遗物了?
She got two Relics now?

20
00:04:47,590 --> 00:04:50,298
而且有馨德在 她还能再得到一个
And with Cinder, the ability to get another.

21
00:04:50,673 --> 00:04:52,590
她不知道信标的遗物在哪里
She doesn't know where the Beacon Relic is.

22
00:04:52,673 --> 00:04:55,548
至少 这点还是值得庆幸的
Well, there's that to be thankful for at least.

23
00:04:55,965 --> 00:04:58,632
我们失去了圣遗物 还赔上了擎天～
We lost Atlas and the Relic.

24
00:04:58,798 --> 00:05:01,715
但是Jaune也说了 我们平安救出了所有人
But we got everyone out safely. Jaune said so

25
00:05:01,757 --> 00:05:05,257
我们为了圣遗物赌上了他们的家园 而我们失败了
We risked their home to save the Relic. And we failed

26
00:05:05,382 --> 00:05:08,257
至少我们成功撤离了所有人啊
Getting everyone out has to count for something.

27
00:05:08,340 --> 00:05:12,965
如果塞伦毁灭了世界 那救人又有什么意义呢?
What good is saving anybody if Salem just destroys the world anyway?

28
00:05:13,965 --> 00:05:16,923
这是埃隆伍德的逻辑 你不是这个意思的
That's how Ironwood thought. You don't mean that.

29
00:05:17,173 --> 00:05:18,132
说完了吗?
Are-you done?

30
00:05:18,923 --> 00:05:20,423
我们得赶快趁天气转坏之前动身
We need to move before the weather turns

31
00:05:20,465 --> 00:05:23,007
不然就要耽误很久才能安全了
or it's gonna take us a lot longer to get to saftey.

32
00:05:30,340 --> 00:05:32,298
之后多的是时间让你们舔舐伤口
There will be plenty of time to lick your wounds later.

33
00:05:33,090 --> 00:05:33,590
走吧
Come on

34
00:05:40,090 --> 00:05:43,132
那么... 再说一次我们要去哪里来着?
So,, Where are we going again?

35
00:05:43,298 --> 00:05:43,923
我的村子
My village.

36
00:05:45,590 --> 00:05:48,548
我还是不敢相信你们竟能靠自己从绯红城堡一路来到这里
I still can't believe you made it all the way from the Crimson Keep on your own.

37
00:05:49,173 --> 00:05:51,132
不是只靠自己的 我们有帮手
Notch our oh. welled felp

38
00:05:54,298 --> 00:05:56,298
我.. 希望那只猫没事
I.. hope the cat is okay.

39
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:59,173
哪只猫?
What cat?

40
00:06:02,215 --> 00:06:03,090
那只猫!
That cat!

41
00:06:08,215 --> 00:06:09,757
呼 终於找到你们了
Phew. I found you.

42
00:06:09,798 --> 00:06:12,715
为什么想要找的东西
Why is it you always find the thing you're looking for

43
00:06:12,757 --> 00:06:14,715
总是藏在最后一个角落里啊
in the very last place you look?

44
00:06:16,298 --> 00:06:19,257
Jaune! 老友啊!
Jaune! Oh my!

45
00:06:19,298 --> 00:06:22,673
已经有不知道多久没见了 是吧?
It has been an indeterminate amount of time, hasn't it?

46
00:06:23,673 --> 00:06:25,382
那 你现在怎样了?
So, how have you been?

47
00:06:25,757 --> 00:06:27,882
等等 你们是认识的?
Wait, you two know each other?

48
00:06:28,048 --> 00:06:30,923
那也正常啊 故事里面就有说
Well, they'd have to. From the story.

49
00:06:31,507 --> 00:06:32,423
啊这 Jaune
Oh, Jaune.

50
00:06:32,798 --> 00:06:34,757
这里可能有什么误会
I think there's a misunderstanding.

51
00:06:34,798 --> 00:06:36,757
猫猫可以带我们离开这里
The cat can get us all out of here.

52
00:06:38,382 --> 00:06:40,215
我们没有时间了
We don't have time for this.

53
00:06:40,257 --> 00:06:41,632
一定要快点到村庄里!
We've got to get to my village!

54
00:06:42,673 --> 00:06:44,715
不用担心 我们不需要向导
Don't worry, we don't need a guide.

55
00:06:45,215 --> 00:06:47,673
但是你的朋友们想要到大树去啊!
But your friends wanted to go to the Tree!

56
00:06:48,257 --> 00:06:50,090
你们想牠带你们去大树那里?
That's where you're letting them take you?

57
00:06:50,132 --> 00:06:51,298
嗯 对啊
Well, yeah.

58
00:06:51,757 --> 00:06:56,590
爱丽克丝..就是这么离开的啊对吧?
That's... how Alyx got out, right?

59
00:06:56,632 --> 00:06:58,590
你什么都没有跟他们说
You didn't tell them anything.

60
00:06:59,173 --> 00:07:00,882
你这就说的不对了
Now that's simply not true.

61
00:07:01,048 --> 00:07:02,590
我告诉他们的事情可多了
I told them plenty of things.

62
00:07:02,715 --> 00:07:05,090
说了几个「一切」 还有很多「一些」
A few anythings and lots of somethings.

63
00:07:05,673 --> 00:07:07,798
有人可以讲讲人话吗?
Can somebody please make sense?

64
00:07:07,965 --> 00:07:09,423
那棵大树就是死亡
That Tree is death.

65
00:07:10,798 --> 00:07:14,298
它会吸收你 抢走你的记忆然后将你变成别的东西
It absorbs you, takes your memories and turns you into something else

66
00:07:14,340 --> 00:07:17,007
你们去那里的话会被抹杀的
If you go there it's going to erase you!

67
00:07:17,673 --> 00:07:20,382
他们管这叫「飞升」
They call it Acsension here.

68
00:07:20,798 --> 00:07:22,090
这才是它的真面目
That's really what it is.

69
00:07:22,840 --> 00:07:26,382
等一下 大树是导致飞升的原因?
Wait. The Tree is what causes Acsension?

70
00:07:27,007 --> 00:07:28,798
这就是抓到草药家的东西
That's what got the Herbalist.

71
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:30,340
大树的树根
The roots of the Tree.

72
00:07:30,382 --> 00:07:33,548
你忽略了这点不提 还挺令人好奇的
Pretty curious you neglected to mention that.

73
00:07:34,715 --> 00:07:36,257
话说得挺漂亮的
Excellent punmanship.

74
00:07:36,465 --> 00:07:38,507
但你们不是这里人
But you are not from here.

75
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:40,673
大树不会对你们起这样的效果的
It won't do that to you guys.

76
00:07:40,923 --> 00:07:41,632
是吗?
Oh yeah?

77
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:44,840
那路易斯发生什么事了?
Then what happened to Lewis?

78
00:07:45,757 --> 00:07:46,465
谁?
Who?

79
00:07:47,882 --> 00:07:48,965
爱丽克丝的兄弟
Alyx's brother.

80
00:07:51,715 --> 00:07:52,298
这...
That..

81
00:07:53,382 --> 00:07:54,673
不可能这样的
That can't be right.

82
00:07:54,715 --> 00:07:56,173
她还有个兄弟?
She had a brother?

83
00:07:56,632 --> 00:07:57,798
为什么你一直没提过他?
Why didn't you mention him?

84
00:07:57,965 --> 00:07:59,798
你们从来没问过啊 笨
Why, you never asked, silly.

85
00:08:00,340 --> 00:08:03,048
你们一直在爱丽克丝来 爱丽克丝去的
It was always Alyx this and Alyx that.

86
00:08:03,090 --> 00:08:06,882
我们一直在跟着故事走 到头来连故事都是假的?
We've been following the story the whole time and it's not even true?

87
00:08:10,257 --> 00:08:11,965
走吧 我有打算了
Let's go. I've got a plan.

88
00:08:12,382 --> 00:08:16,465
这多少年了 你有计划又有过什么用了?
A lot of good that's done you after what, how many years?

89
00:08:16,507 --> 00:08:18,298
你们可以停一下吗?
Can everybody please stop?

90
00:08:18,757 --> 00:08:20,632
一时半刻这很难消化
This is a lot to take in.

91
00:08:21,382 --> 00:08:24,090
那看来我们是卡在分岔点了
Looks like we are stuck in a crossroads then.

92
00:08:24,423 --> 00:08:25,257
不要!
No!

93
00:08:33,715 --> 00:08:34,257
可恶
Dammit.

94
00:08:35,923 --> 00:08:38,132
欢迎来到一场心灵风暴
Welcom to a ponderstorm.

95
00:08:38,798 --> 00:08:45,048
是一种呃 会具现化你的精神或者情绪上问题的天气
A uh, weather pattern that creates a physical manifestation of a mental or emotional problem.

96
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:51,215
所以现在我们正处于象征和物理意义上的分岔路了
So we appear to be in a metaphorical and literal crossroads.

97
00:08:51,632 --> 00:08:54,882
有够完美又白痴地呈现出永恒仙境的风格
How perfectly, stupidly Ever After-y.

98
00:08:55,673 --> 00:08:57,423
这地方真坑
This place really is the pits.

99
00:08:57,590 --> 00:08:58,798
啊啊啊啊啊!!
Ahhhh!!!

100
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:03,340
唯一离开的方法就只有解决这里的问题 或是等到风暴结束
The only way out is to resolve the problem, or wait until the storm passes.

101
00:09:03,507 --> 00:09:04,423
还是赶紧走吧
Let's just get moving.

102
00:09:04,465 --> 00:09:06,882
啊啊啊啊啊!!!
Ahhhh!!!

103
00:09:07,215 --> 00:09:08,882
行吧 是我自找的
Okay, I asked for that.

104
00:09:10,173 --> 00:09:12,632
Yang在哪?还有Blake?
Where's Yang? And Blake?

105
00:09:13,298 --> 00:09:15,007
她们可能有更重要的事情要解决
Must've had something bigger to work out.

106
00:09:18,132 --> 00:09:19,298
蛤?
Huh?

107
00:09:21,423 --> 00:09:22,048
Blake!
Blake!

108
00:09:24,298 --> 00:09:25,423
Yang!
Yang!

109
00:09:26,257 --> 00:09:27,215
我们该怎么办?
What do we do?

110
00:09:29,757 --> 00:09:31,590
我们需要去到那个平台
We need to get to that platform.

111
00:09:34,132 --> 00:09:36,673
但是下一步该怎么走呢?
But how do we take the next step?

112
00:09:50,048 --> 00:09:53,132
如果你们赶紧做个决定的话这过程会快很多
You know this would go quicker if you make up your minds

113
00:09:56,215 --> 00:10:00,673
我还是不理解这个故事到底为什么是真的... 但又不是真的
I just don't get how the story is both real... and not.

114
00:10:06,048 --> 00:10:06,715
所有的事情都有发生
It all happened.

115
00:10:11,590 --> 00:10:13,632
不过不是爱丽克丝写的那样
Just not the way Alyx said when she wrote it.

116
00:10:21,173 --> 00:10:23,840
所以呢?她撒谎了?
So, what? She just lied?

117
00:10:24,048 --> 00:10:26,382
你不懂...
You have no idea...

118
00:10:29,507 --> 00:10:35,257
我在等你们也掉下来 等了好多年 但其他人却先出现了
I waited for you to fall for years, but somebody else showed up first.

119
00:10:36,007 --> 00:10:39,382
是爱丽克丝 和她的兄弟路易斯
It was Alyx, and her brother Lewis.

120
00:10:39,882 --> 00:10:41,173
一对来自树不子的兄妹
Two siblings from Remnant.

121
00:10:42,173 --> 00:10:44,090
我跟他们说 我也来自树不子
I told them I was from there too.

122
00:10:44,340 --> 00:10:45,715
我在等我的朋友们
I was waiting for my friends.

123
00:10:46,882 --> 00:10:51,840
当我开始帮他们的时候 我很快就意识到了我是在她的故事里
Once I started helping them, it didn't take long for me to figure out I was in her story.

124
00:10:52,007 --> 00:10:54,465
我就是锈迹骑士
I was the Rusted Knight.

125
00:10:55,423 --> 00:10:58,590
但是 现实与书里的故事却不一样
But, things weren't always the same as the book.

126
00:10:59,882 --> 00:11:00,590
例如爱丽克丝...
Like Alyx...

127
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:05,715
她并不只是有些坏心眼 或是不体贴人...
She wasn't just a little petulant, or inconsiderate...

128
00:11:06,548 --> 00:11:07,715
她很自私...
She was selfish...

129
00:11:08,548 --> 00:11:09,007
也很残忍...
Cruel...

130
00:11:10,215 --> 00:11:14,257
就好像这整个世界都只是个幻象 这里的规则与她无关
Like this whole world was simply make-believe, and the rules didn't apply for her.

131
00:11:15,423 --> 00:11:18,507
路易斯是善良的那个 也更聪明
Lewis was the kind one, the clever one.

132
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:22,090
我们去了书里并没有提到的地方
We went places she didn't mention in the story.

133
00:11:22,548 --> 00:11:23,465
就像草药屋
Like the herbalist.

134
00:11:24,340 --> 00:11:26,465
在那 有些什么被改变了
Something changed there.

135
00:11:27,048 --> 00:11:30,840
不知道草药师对她说了什么 从那之后她就变得不一样了
Whatever he said to her, she wasn't the same after that.

136
00:11:31,465 --> 00:11:33,715
她对我们失去了信任
She lost all trust in us.

137
00:11:34,007 --> 00:11:35,590
开始质疑我们
Started accusing us of things.

138
00:11:35,632 --> 00:11:40,257
我越努力地将故事拉回正轨 她就更加不信任我
The more I tried to get the story back on track, the more she distrusted me.

139
00:11:41,423 --> 00:11:44,132
是我的错吗?是我改变了故事吗?
Was it my fault? Did I change the story?

140
00:11:45,257 --> 00:11:47,382
我甚至在虚构世界里都无法成为英雄
I couldn't even be the make-believe hero.

141
00:11:49,673 --> 00:11:51,090
我甚至没有时间做正确的事
I didn't have time to make it right.

142
00:11:52,923 --> 00:11:55,882
锈迹骑士替爱丽克丝喝下了毒药
The Rusted Knight drank the poison, in her stead.

143
00:11:57,673 --> 00:12:00,423
她说她不会让任何人阻拦她回家的道路
She said she wouldn't let any one get in the way of her leaving.

144
00:12:00,965 --> 00:12:02,173
她会不择手段找到回去的路
That she'd do whatever it takes.

145
00:12:03,215 --> 00:12:04,132
然后她就离开了
And then she was gone.

146
00:12:06,673 --> 00:12:10,382
所以啊 这不再是我最喜欢的故事了
So, not exactly my favorite story anymore.

147
00:12:10,923 --> 00:12:12,923
抱歉
I'm so sorry.

148
00:12:13,965 --> 00:12:16,382
等等 那你为什么不信任那只猫?
Wait, why don't you trust the cat then?

149
00:12:18,798 --> 00:12:20,882
因为那只猫在永恒仙境中的职责
The cat's role in the Ever After.

150
00:12:21,882 --> 00:12:25,340
那是在爱丽克丝离开后 它回来找我时我明白的
I figured it out later when the cat came back for me once Alyx left.

151
00:12:26,340 --> 00:12:28,298
当这里的人迷失了自我
When people lose their way here,

152
00:12:28,340 --> 00:12:31,048
猫会劝说他们
...the cat convinces them, somehow,

153
00:12:31,673 --> 00:12:36,173
要么继续做好他们该做的 要么就去那棵树 重新找到自己的意义
...either to keep performing their role, or to go to the tree, get a new one.

154
00:12:37,090 --> 00:12:40,798
那只猫管这个过程叫「治愈」但它其实就是在给人洗脑
The cat calls it "healing", but, it's manipulation.

155
00:12:41,507 --> 00:12:44,548
它从来都不是在帮爱丽克丝 也不是在帮你
The cat was never helping Alyx, or you.

156
00:12:45,632 --> 00:12:48,590
牠的职责就是喂养那棵树
Their purpose here is to feed the tree.

157
00:12:49,548 --> 00:12:51,507
让世间的循环能够继续
To keep the cycle going

158
00:12:51,548 --> 00:12:52,882
你怎么能确定的?
Howcan you be sure?

159
00:12:53,673 --> 00:12:56,257
因为猫把爱丽克丝和路易斯都带去了那棵树
Because the cat took Alyx and Lewis there.

160
00:12:57,215 --> 00:12:59,965
但只有一个人回到了我们的世界
Only one of them made it back to our world.

161
00:13:12,923 --> 00:13:13,632
你还好吗?
You alright?

162
00:13:13,673 --> 00:13:17,632
等我们一起踏上那个平台的时候肯定好多了
Will feel a lot better when we are together on that platform.

163
00:13:23,923 --> 00:13:26,757
呃 是有密码之类的吗?
Uhh, is it a password or something?

164
00:13:27,507 --> 00:13:28,215
一起
Together.

165
00:13:29,423 --> 00:13:30,423
平台
Platform.

166
00:13:32,298 --> 00:13:33,007
不行吗?
No luck?

167
00:13:35,090 --> 00:13:38,007
我相信你一定会找到办法的 你一直很会想办法
I'm sure you'll figure it out though, you're good at that.

168
00:13:38,673 --> 00:13:39,632
你真的这么想吗?
You think so?

169
00:13:39,673 --> 00:13:41,632
是啊
Well, yeah.

170
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:44,048
你脑子很好
You've got a really good brain.

171
00:13:47,132 --> 00:13:48,548
行 这招有用
Okay, that did something.

172
00:13:49,090 --> 00:13:51,132
呃 我讲了关于你的事
Uhh, I talked about you.

173
00:13:51,173 --> 00:13:53,382
所以... 咳咳
So... ahem.

174
00:13:53,882 --> 00:13:56,007
你有猫耳朵
You have cat ears.

175
00:14:02,590 --> 00:14:04,257
我觉得你的猫耳朵很可爱
I think your cat ears are cute.

176
00:14:06,798 --> 00:14:07,673
完美
Nailed it.

177
00:14:08,382 --> 00:14:10,715
虽然我还是不知道"关卡"是什么
Even thought I don't know what "it" is yet.

178
00:14:11,882 --> 00:14:17,882
可能是说一些我们从来... 没有跟对方说过的话
Maybe it's saying things we've never said... to each other.

179
00:14:23,632 --> 00:14:28,132
我觉得你是个很棒很棒的人
I think you're an extraordinary person.

180
00:14:29,007 --> 00:14:33,090
你永远会第一个缓解紧绷的气氛
You're always the first to lighten a situation.

181
00:14:33,590 --> 00:14:35,965
即使在你害怕的时候 你也依然勇敢
You act bravely when you're afraid.

182
00:14:36,965 --> 00:14:38,632
你一定会说到做到
You do what you say.

183
00:14:46,257 --> 00:14:47,132
你也要加油啊
Try to keep up.

184
00:14:49,757 --> 00:14:55,048
我很高兴 你从来没有害怕过我 就算你还不太喜欢我的时候也是
I like that you've never been intimidated by me, even when you didn't like me all that much.

185
00:14:55,673 --> 00:14:58,132
我当时对于所有人都没什么好想法
I was a little weary of people in general.

186
00:14:58,923 --> 00:15:01,257
但你从来没有放弃过他们 即使他们伤害过你
But you never gave up on them even when they hurt you.

187
00:15:02,132 --> 00:15:03,257
你从不放弃
You never gave up.

188
00:15:03,757 --> 00:15:05,257
你知道什么对你来说是最重要的
You know what matters to you.

189
00:15:08,173 --> 00:15:09,632
咱们速战速决吧
Let's make this quicker.

190
00:15:10,048 --> 00:15:12,548
还有什么我们没说过的大秘密吗?
Any big truths we haven't dropped on each other yet?

191
00:15:24,132 --> 00:15:28,548
你刚刚是想到了什么 但没说出来吗?
Did you just think of something but didn't say it?

192
00:15:30,382 --> 00:15:32,882
应该不是因为那个吧
That can't be what this is about.

193
00:15:36,132 --> 00:15:38,798
就像一座悬崖
It's like a cliff.

194
00:15:40,798 --> 00:15:44,298
如果我迈出了那一步 我就会坠落
And if I do it, I'm just going to fall.

195
00:15:45,715 --> 00:15:48,007
我想我们已经在坠落了
I think we are already falling.

196
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:53,173
说出来吧 Yang
Just, say it. Yang.

197
00:15:57,257 --> 00:15:58,840
我想 我爱你
I think I love you.

198
00:15:58,882 --> 00:15:59,757
我也爱你
I love you too.

199
00:16:35,423 --> 00:16:36,548
哇哦 真奇怪
Woo how odd.

200
00:16:37,048 --> 00:16:40,132
这次你们在我搜第一个角落时就找到了
This time you are in the first place I looked, rather than the last.

201
00:16:40,173 --> 00:16:41,465
Jaune跟我们说了
Jaune told us.

202
00:16:43,298 --> 00:16:45,632
我还以为是什么事呢
I thought there was more to the story.

203
00:16:45,882 --> 00:16:48,590
所以你们因为某些事情要控诉我?彼此彼此啦
You're accusing me of something? Same page now.

204
00:16:48,882 --> 00:16:50,798
就是你把仙境居民献给大树的
You the one who gives Afterans to the tree.

205
00:16:51,590 --> 00:16:53,590
你为什么不告诉我们真相?
Why haven't you been telling us the truth?

206
00:16:54,507 --> 00:17:00,007
当仙境居民不太清醒的时候 我会帮树他们回到永恒仙境 是的
When Afterans get all higgledy piggledy, help them return to the Ever After, yes.

207
00:17:00,215 --> 00:17:02,465
但你不是这里的人
But you're not Afterans.

208
00:17:02,632 --> 00:17:04,173
我带你们去那边可不是为了飞升的
I'm not taking you there to ascend.

209
00:17:04,215 --> 00:17:07,507
我带你们去是因为你们有好多有意思的事情可以告诉我
I'm taking you there because you all have such delightful information for me.

210
00:17:07,757 --> 00:17:10,632
我们遇见你时你假装你从来没听过这个故事
You pretended like you'd never heard of the story when you met us.

211
00:17:10,840 --> 00:17:12,673
但Jaune早就告诉过你了
But Jaune had already told you.

212
00:17:12,923 --> 00:17:18,090
我想现在的老Jaune头可能已经有些神智不清了
Ithink old Jaune's maybe a few sand-berries short of a picnic these days.

213
00:17:18,423 --> 00:17:19,382
你说是不是?
Wouldn't you say?

214
00:17:20,340 --> 00:17:23,632
你把爱丽克丝和路易斯带去大树下时到底发生了什么
What happened when you took Alyx and Lewis to the tree.

215
00:17:25,673 --> 00:17:28,132
我不知道...
l... I don't know..

216
00:17:29,090 --> 00:17:32,840
她告诉我她会带我穿过那扇门一起去树不子 但是
She had told me she'd take me with her through the door to Remnant, but...

217
00:17:33,590 --> 00:17:34,173
她骗了我
She tricked me.

218
00:17:35,757 --> 00:17:39,382
就像你们
Just like all of you.

219
00:17:42,132 --> 00:17:46,132
你们只是想利用我 就像我也只是利用他人获取信息和知识一样
You only want to use me in the same way I've only seen others as sources of knowledge and entertainment.

220
00:17:47,507 --> 00:17:51,423
好吧 至少现在 我知道有什么不该做了
Well, at least now I know what not to do.

221
00:17:51,965 --> 00:17:55,215
我们... 我们只是想回家.
We... we just want to get home...

222
00:17:56,882 --> 00:18:00,590
谢谢你给我上的一课 Ruby Rose 猎人
Thank you for this lesson, Ruby Rose Huntress.

223
00:18:01,298 --> 00:18:02,590
我该走了
I'll be on my way now.

224
00:18:03,090 --> 00:18:04,590
你就跟你的「朋友」在一起吧
Stay with your "friend".

225
00:18:20,632 --> 00:18:21,840
我们错过了什么吗?
Did we miss anything?

226
00:18:23,298 --> 00:18:25,173
感觉我好像已经为这一幕等了好久好久
Feels like I've been waiting forever for that.

227
00:18:26,423 --> 00:18:27,590
走吧
Come on.

228
00:18:41,757 --> 00:18:46,507
嘿 有件物品我一直替你保管着
Hey, there's something I've been holding onto for you.

229
00:18:47,423 --> 00:18:51,173
这是我坠落时看到的第一个东西
It was the first thing I saw when I was falling.

230
00:18:52,465 --> 00:18:56,340
很多年以后 等我终于找到它的时候 我就知道我...
Years later, when I finally found it, I knew I'd...

231
00:19:01,923 --> 00:19:03,007
Ruby?
Ruby?

232
00:19:05,632 --> 00:19:06,507
耶!
Hey!

233
00:19:08,923 --> 00:19:14,215
我... 谢谢你 Jaune
I... Thank you Jaune.

234
00:19:15,007 --> 00:19:16,132
不用谢
Don't mention it

235
00:19:18,007 --> 00:19:18,673
Jaune?
Jaune?

236
00:19:20,548 --> 00:19:22,048
路易斯怎么了?
What did happen to Lewis?

237
00:19:24,173 --> 00:19:29,298
我想 爱丽克丝把他作为回家的代价 献给了大树
I think Alyx traded him to the tree in order to leave.

238
00:19:30,507 --> 00:19:32,757
然后 她将他从故事中彻底地抹去
And then she wrote him out of the story.

239
00:19:34,882 --> 00:19:35,632
晚安 各位
Goodnight, everyone.